# LLM Endpoint Configuration
# Format: model_name endpoint_url
# 
# This file maps model names to their API endpoints.
# You can optionally use this instead of LISA_API_BASE in .env
#
# Example:
# dilowa https://api.llama-api.com/v1
# gpt4 https://api.openai.com/v1
# local-model http://localhost:8000/v1
#
# The service will automatically append /chat/completions to the URL

dilowa https://api.llama-api.com/v1
